config BR2_PACKAGE_FPLINUX_TYRQUAKE
	bool "fplinux-tyrquake"
	depends on BR2_USE_MMU
	help
	  Build TyrQuake 0.71 with native TA-1618 fbdev and
	  evdev backends. The software renderer rotates its
	  logical 320x240 image into the 240x320 RGB565
	  framebuffer and uses both pages. Sound, CD audio and
	  networking are disabled.

	  The launcher uses a fixed 32 MiB heap and one input
	  mode: the phone keypad or the forwarded host keyboard.
	  Game data is not included. A user-supplied pak0.pak is
	  read from microSD at run time.
